        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sea_Level%2C_North_Carolina"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The community lies adjacent to Core Sound, a narrow inlet that feeds the Atlantic.",
